{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5a3fe05f797860a87233c4aa7acce2f7e544bd9ad5ed6618cb8ee7cfc27ab70d", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのアイドルを探しに、中学校の\n文化祭で行われる、バンドのステージを見に来た）", "zh": "（为了寻找适合39PROJECT的偶像，\n我跑来看国中文化祭上的乐团表演。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7943d8bfbd64cc31619c1da8fe6eee2ab7a64c5f33c303555c953f565153566d", "ja": "（文化祭の出し物か、懐かしいな。\nここは……ゲーム部か）", "zh": "（文化祭的摆摊啊，好怀念。\n这里是……游戏社吗。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8c14131bf584763e783c19b697e01f1a7c91521dc0d5953d2824a6771c23797f", "ja": "（あの子は、何をしてるんだろう。受付かな？）", "zh": "（那孩子在做什么呢？是接待员吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1004_se", "source_sha256": "84442c307c0e8e15c5798628ba6621d08130e6f4ea70a855b77b3df2aa305fa1", "ja": "ビシッ、バシッ。\nザシュッ！", "zh": "叩，砰。\n咻！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "6f73a7ce04cca1722b595f05ab379eedc6eecfabb18e6fb688363863debfe449", "ja": "ん…………やった。\n杏奈の勝ち、だね……クリア……。", "zh": "嗯…………太好了。\n是杏奈赢了吧……过关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "bfd56ab798539d544462d91d56e53a60c44bddf8efc362ad8a46342136a01ba4", "ja": "次のステージも……頑張る……。", "zh": "下一关也要……加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c890aaf9aaba4802ef64973fb937225b07fe2c403e69c409044a9919449c4010", "ja": "おお……今の対戦、すごかったな！\n君、ゲーム好きなの？", "zh": "哦哦……刚才的对战，好厉害喔！\n你喜欢玩游戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "621c2f41a7d390aa19bc915bbbb8c3f102ac0fd2802f46789855c711b98faa71", "ja": "（あ、あれ？　もしかして、聞こえていないのか？\nすごい集中力だな……）", "zh": "（奇、奇怪？她该不会没听到吧？\n好强的集中力啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "da6fe5d65e5328927aecc3d8487da672a7995e3c64135d649afbe19aa895a124", "ja": "……よし。\n……いい感じ……これなら……勝てる……。", "zh": "……很好……\n感觉不错……这样的话……能赢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8e9f6fb9074e5c0866788b6d57f3758c5485de7424ec6e5493fddc0843b17ea1", "ja": "（お、そろそろ体育館でバンドのステージが\n始まる時間だ。そっちに行くとするか…）", "zh": "（哦，乐团差不多要在体育馆表演了，\n先过去那边吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1013_null", "source_sha256": "9fc5931b435b4f4f2fd1cd93859a4d16d6e54257140a7f77773d99d09eeeecf5", "ja": "2時間後……", "zh": "两个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7edacd910eca9235e8d18945deed1c760ea582a7a546bb019d100fd31dbd7295", "ja": "（ひと通りステージを見てみたけど、\nこの子だって思える子は、いなかったな）", "zh": "（虽然把表演看过了一轮，\n但没看到适合的人选呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "41febbd33c6196799c120a7c346fad10bb52e896808cf122efb88df2764b12fa", "ja": "みんなー！　ビビッと盛り上がってるー！？", "zh": "大家──！有没有充满活力地嗨起来啊──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1ec10067101a0e768418fbd5c5e1522b89989b7f1041df03ad896c6844fd3d0d", "ja": "（なんだ、今の声？\n一体どこから……体育館の裏か？）", "zh": "（刚才的声音是怎么回事？\n从哪传来的……是体育馆后面吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "17d06333b4f290e8dc728f23456883dbb9c4c603dd657b684b05841ca9190f0d", "ja": "今日は、杏奈のライブに来てくれてありがとう！\nみんな、思いっきり楽しんでいってね！", "zh": "谢谢你们今天来到杏奈的演唱会！\n请大家尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "51599e4d4ddfa42969a6c4fcd14b9fcab9494c9858dd65befbd6b2c39958d0f5", "ja": "それじゃあ、杏奈の新曲を聞いてください！\nビビッと、いっくよー！！", "zh": "那么，请听杏奈的新歌！\n要充满活力地开始啰──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "558ca325768d8e432b18b0ea4e8b1d2ad5b2df5fea3d838ef65ceac6186be40c", "ja": "（あれは、ゲームをしていた子じゃないか！\nもしかして、アイドルの真似をしてるのか？）", "zh": "（那不是刚才在玩游戏的孩子吗！\n她该不会是在模仿偶像吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1aeee951c3ccc5f933adf9174c012b4f165adc5460cc1aadabd7d79f475be0a9", "ja": "（さっきは、満足に会話もできなかったけど……\n今はまるで、別人みたいに輝いているな！）", "zh": "（刚才她似乎连跟人对话都无法顺利进行……\n现在却像换了个人一样，闪闪发光的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "ff1d81427fa5a460d48f14158618a0649fe707ed3409d794c7dffb6186845bf8", "ja": "曲名はー…………あ。", "zh": "曲名是…………啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "71ed75059c01f63e0fbb066feca6e557905bf6735dd233cdc7c338abd94f12c3", "ja": "やあ、こんにちは。\n君、アイドルが好きなのかな？", "zh": "嗨，你好。\n同学，你喜欢偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d6b64abb267130b85a277d2f83f68858b44df1c3e4d14c702be5fd9bba6957f0", "ja": "（今のは、聞こえてるよな……人見知りなのか？\nでもさっきの笑顔は、本当に魅力的だった！）", "zh": "（她应该有听到我说的话吧……是怕生吗？\n不过她刚才的笑容真的很有魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_1026", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f2a701b5fce1dca177be0d34f20d6768080f605e3cb529088477e023de2af5a0", "ja": "君、よかったらアイドルにならないか？\n実は俺、アイドルのプロデューサーをしているんだ。", "zh": "同学，愿意的话要不要来当偶像？\n其实我是偶像制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2001_024ann", "source_sha256": "7fdbd451efedcc00173ab70ad14decc831fac33eb3c890af566d07ba64eebd2d", "ja": "アイドルの……プロデューサー……。", "zh": "偶像……制作人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "081bb5b5eea3ac194f579f3a88217bd709e659663a959cd71c14f16cd150aabc", "ja": "え……っ。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2003_p", "source_sha256": "8741a8b4b0c226b73cd04ccaf765d18bab5e5af5d67a71b6cc7d3b69b305dcf7", "ja": "今日はここに、アイドル候補を探しに来たんだ。\n興味があるなら、ぜひ話を聞いてほしい。", "zh": "我今天是来这里找偶像候补人选的。\n如果有兴趣的话，请听听我的说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2004_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b8f0e3fa2d9ffd5e7b578953b09026c1f02c69e52170967e8d6e9c20c02afe6", "ja": "あ……あの……！", "zh": "那……那个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2005_024ann", "source_sha256": "e83efd45ff5a556d6a97bd5bb7f19ab84bd763a81d4ebdf0392e3365586eaee7", "ja": "杏奈……歌、好きです……。\nアイドル……カワイイから、好き……。", "zh": "杏奈……喜欢，唱歌……\n偶像……很可爱，喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2006_024ann", "source_sha256": "ec391c6ebd16e49849e6f525f35305b3476c3985f9920a1b2d78ed4f4ca6ed42", "ja": "杏奈が……アイドル……。", "zh": "杏奈……想要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2007_024ann", "source_sha256": "51b4a362f8f9a7445db201d2eefb2a13fcdc78a802a109f590fef2b67aaa29e9", "ja": "なり、たい……です。杏奈、アイドルに……。\n杏奈……なれます……か……？", "zh": "当……偶像。杏奈，想当偶像……\n杏奈……当得了……吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "13b4d5f6bdbbcce60c1abdadfdb557c1e63be38a25fa84d2748d3aa030576bdb", "ja": "ああ、君ならきっとなれる！\nだから、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，你一定可以的！\n所以我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2009_024ann", "source_sha256": "f5d867a23029ddde2fdaa3d2a0392693a93466648d91885a401de3f1abbd353e", "ja": "ん……。杏奈、頑張り……ます……。\nプロデューサー、さん……よろしく、です……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈，会……加油……\n制作人，先生……请多指教……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_024ann_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "8d02fbfeec40cc8c0c0372021cc5121890d72e55bbd3c87f7453eb5c31803744", "ja": "（さっきの笑顔が、まだ頭から離れない。あの笑顔を\nステージでも輝かせられるように、頑張ろう！）", "zh": "（她刚才的笑容，还在我脑中挥之不去。\n为了让那笑容也能在舞台上发光，我要努力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
